193	    /**
194	     * Resolves the canonical region a city belongs to using the fixed city-to-region table
195	     * ({@code Sydney -> NSW}, {@code Melbourne -> VIC}, {@code Brisbane -> QLD}). Returns the
196	     * region string, or {@code null} when the city has no known region. This is the single
197	     * definition of the city-to-region mapping, shared by every rule that derives a region
198	     * from an owner's city.
